{"step_index":249,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:54:13Z","content":"I have completed the requests:\n\n1. **Enhanced the User Interface Design**: Refined the React UI styling with a high-end dark glassmorphism theme (`index.css`), animated status indicators, active navigation pills (`Sidebar.tsx`), glowing border cards, crisp typography, and visual feedback.\n2. **Completed Academic Phase Deliverables**:\n   - **Phase 11 – Secure Development and Build Environment [6 Marks]**\n   - **Phase 12 – Secure Coding and Refactoring [4 Marks]**\n   - **Phase 13 – Containerized Development: Docker and Kubernetes [7 Marks]**\n\n---\n\n# 📦 Summary of Academic Deliverables\n\n### 1. Phase 11 – Secure Development & Build Environment [6 Marks]\n📄 **Deliverable File:** [`phase11_secure_development_environment.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/phase11_secure_development_environment.md)\n\n* **Git Branching Strategy**: GitFlow model (`main`, `develop`, `feature/*`, `hotfix/*`) with mandatory PR code reviews and linear history enforcement.\n* **5 Security Controls**:\n  1. *Least Privilege*: Non-root runtime execution (`appuser` UID 10001).\n  2. *Secret Management*: Decoupled environment configuration using [`.env.example`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/.env.example) and Kubernetes Secrets.\n  3. *Dependency Control*: SHA-256 integrity hash pinning in lockfiles.\n  4. *Code Review & Branch Protection*: Blocked direct pushes to `main` and required 2 approving reviews.\n  5. *Artifact Integrity*: Cryptographic SHA-256 digests & Cosign signature tracking.\n* **Secret Non-Hardcoding Proof**: Demonstrates runtime `.env` configuration template.\n* **Static Analysis Report & Remediation**: Documents automated static vulnerability checks (`B105` hardcoded fallback secret refactored to env extraction; `B307` dynamic `eval()` replaced with safe `packaging.version.parse()`).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Phase 12 – Secure Coding & Refactoring [4 Marks]\n📄 **Deliverable File:** [`phase12_secure_coding_refactoring.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/phase12_secure_coding_refactoring.md)  \n💻 **Source Code Module:** [`backend/app/api/auth.py`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/app/api/auth.py)\n\n* **Implemented Module**: JWT Authentication & Role-Based Access Control (`Student`, `Faculty`, `Administrator`, `SecurityAnalyst`).\n* **Vulnerability Refactoring Identified**:\n  1. *Weakness 1 (CWE-259 / Plaintext Passwords & Timing Attacks)*: Refactored legacy `==` comparison to Bcrypt salted key stretching (`passlib`) with constant-time evaluation.\n  2. *Weakness 2 (CWE-20 / Missing Input Validation)*: Refactored raw string endpoints to Pydantic v2 schemas enforcing strict length and regex pattern constraints (`pattern=r\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$\"`).\n* **Security Justification**: Prevents password rainbow table leaks, user enumeration, horizontal/vertical privilege escalation (CWE-269), and buffer injection vectors.\n\n---\n\n### 3. Phase 13 – Containerized Development: Docker & Kubernetes [7 Marks]\n📄 **Deliverable File:** [`phase13_containerization_kubernetes.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/phase13_containerization_kubernetes.md)  \n📁 **Kubernetes Manifests:** [`k8s/`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/)\n\n* **Hardened Dockerfiles**:\n  * [`backend/Dockerfile`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/Dockerfile): Multi-stage `python:3.11-slim` image creating non-root `appuser` (UID 10001).\n  * [`frontend/Dockerfile`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/frontend/Dockerfile): Multi-stage `node:20-alpine` build with `serve` under non-root `appuser` (UID 10002).\n* **4 Container Security Practices**: Minimal base images, non-root user execution, controlled port exposure (`8001` / `5173`), and decoupled layer secret handling.\n* **Kubernetes Manifests Created**:\n  * [`k8s/namespace.yaml`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/namespace.yaml): `securechain-prod` namespace isolation.\n  * [`k8s/secrets.yaml`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/secrets.yaml): Encrypted secrets configuration.\n  * [`k8s/backend-deployment.yaml`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/backend-deployment.yaml) & [`backend-service.yaml`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/backend-service.yaml).\n  * [`k8s/frontend-deployment.yaml`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/frontend-deployment.yaml) & [`frontend-service.yaml`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/frontend-service.yaml).\n* **2 Kubernetes Security Controls Demonstrated**:\n  1. *Strict Security Context*: `runAsNonRoot: true`, `readOnlyRootFilesystem: true`, `allowPrivilegeEscalation: false`.\n  2. *Resource Limits & Namespace Isolation*: CPU/Memory request and ceiling limits enforcing computational boundary controls."}
