{"step_index":255,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-08T09:59:48Z","content":"Here is the **exact step-by-step guide** on how to run the application on your computer:\n\n---\n\n### Step 1: Start the Backend (API Server)\n\n1. Open **PowerShell** (or Command Prompt) on your computer.\n2. Copy and paste this line, then press **Enter**:\n   ```powershell\n   cd c:\\Users\\addal\\Documents\\antigravity\\focused-bell\\backend\n   ```\n3. Type this command and press **Enter**:\n   ```powershell\n   python main.py\n   ```\n4. You will see text saying `Uvicorn running on http://127.0.0.1:8001`.\n   *(⚠️ Keep this terminal window open! Do not close it.)*\n\n---\n\n### Step 2: Start the Frontend (User Interface)\n\n1. Open a **SECOND** PowerShell window (keep the first one running).\n2. Copy and paste this line, then press **Enter**:\n   ```powershell\n   cd c:\\Users\\addal\\Documents\\antigravity\\focused-bell\\frontend\n   ```\n3. Type this command and press **Enter**:\n   ```powershell\n   npm run dev\n   ```\n4. You will see text saying `Local: http://localhost:5173/`.\n   *(⚠️ Keep this second terminal window open as well!)*\n\n---\n\n### Step 3: Open the Platform in Your Browser\n\n1. Open Chrome, Edge, or Firefox.\n2. Go to this web address:  \n   👉 **`http://localhost:5173`**\n\n---\n\n### 💡 What You Will See When You Open It:\n* **Dashboard Page**: Real-time security statistics, supply chain workflow diagram, and threat breakdown charts.\n* **Projects Page**: Click on `payment-gateway-service` or `auth-identity-service` to view dependency trees, builds, and artifacts.\n* **Run Scan Button**: Click **\"Run Scan\"** on any project to execute a live security scan for dependency confusion, malicious packages, and secret leaks!"}
