execution), Secret Management (Decoupled `.env`), Dependency Control (SHA-256 lockfile pinning), Code Review (PR policies), Reproducible Builds (Cosign & SHA-256 artifact integrity).\n* **Secret Non-Hardcoding Proof**: Environment variable template ([`backend/.env.example`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/.env.example)).\n* **Static Analysis Report & Remediation**: Documents static scanner findings (`B105` hardcoded secret refactored to env lookup; `B307` dynamic `eval()` replaced with `packaging.version.parse()`).\n\n---\n\n### Phase 12 Deliverable (4 Marks)\n📄 **Deliverable File:** [`phase12_secure_coding_refactoring.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/phase12_secure_coding_refactoring.md)  \n💻 **Source Code Module:** [`backend/app/api/auth.py`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/app/api/auth.py)\n* **Module Implemented**: JWT Authentication & Role-Based Access Control (`Student`, `Faculty`, `Administrator`, `SecurityAnalyst`).\n* **Weaknesses Refactored**:\n  1. *Plaintext Comparison (CWE-259)*: Refactored legacy `==` comparison to salted PBKDF2 key stretching (`100,000` iterations) with constant-time equality checks.\n  2. *Missing Input Boundary Checks (CWE-20)*: Refactored raw parameter endpoints to Pydantic v2 schemas with strict regex pattern and length validation (`pattern=r\"^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+$\"`).\n* **Security Justification**: Eliminates password rainbow table vulnerabilities, user timing attacks, vertical privilege escalation, and payload injection risks.\n\n---\n\n### Phase 13 Deliverable (7 Marks)\n📄 **Deliverable File:** [`phase13_containerization_kubernetes.md`](file:///c:/Users/addal/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2ac62f09-2e24-4efd-bd40-62368c77dbf2/phase13_containerization_kubernetes.md)  \n📁 **Kubernetes Manifests:** [`k8s/`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/k8s/)\n* **Hardened Dockerfiles**:\n  * [`backend/Dockerfile`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/backend/Dockerfile): Multi-stage slim image creating non-root `appuser` (UID 10001).\n  * [`frontend/Dockerfile`](file:///c:/Users/addal/Documents/antigravity/focused-bell/frontend/Dockerfile): Multi-stage Alpine image with `serve` under non-root `appuser` (UID 10002).\n* **4 Container Security Practices**: Minimal base image, non-root execution, controlled port exposure (`8001`/`5173`), secret separation.\n* **Kubernetes Security Controls**:\n  1. *Strict Security Context*: `runAsNonRoot: true`, `readOnlyRootFilesystem: true`, `allowPrivilegeEscalation: false`.\n  2. *Resource Limits & Isolation*: `securechain-prod` namespace isolation with CPU/Memory request and ceiling limits."}
